# Copilot Instructions

Follow the project guide in [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) for layout, commands, and
conventions. Do not duplicate those facts here.

## Copilot-specific mechanics

- Plan before editing: explore the relevant module, propose a short plan, then implement
- Work in small, reviewable steps; stop after each step for review
- Run the gate commands from `AGENTS.md` before declaring a change done
